      "width": 720,
      "height": 360,
      "label": "① Goal",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "0000000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 360,
      "label": "② System Structure",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0000000000000003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 420,
      "label": "③ Current Work",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0000000000000004",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 860,
      "label": "④ Evidence",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "0000000000000005",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 420,
      "label": "⑤ Risks & Decisions",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Goal: SkyTurn evidence-backed desktop workflow\nSuccess: user task -> canvas plan -> agent runs -> validation/artifacts -> explicit delivery gates\nConstraints: desktop, canvas-first, not IDE/file tabs/global terminal\nTruth: RunEvidence, git/worktree state, tests, artifacts, workflow events"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: Desktop App & IPC\nRole: Electron shell, preload API, backend gates\nInputs: user project, workflow actions\nOutputs: safe IPC and persisted events"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: UI Canvas\nRole: @xyflow canvas, compact nodes, Node Modal\nInputs: projected sessions, runs, evidence\nOutputs: Output/Changes/Context UX"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: Workflow Kernel\nRole: validate intents, compile lanes, schedule DAG\nInputs: Hermes WorkflowIntent, dependencies\nOutputs: cards, edges, lane execution policy"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: Agent Runtime & Bridge\nRole: adapter contracts, discovery, run lifecycle\nInputs: Hermes/Codex requests, sandbox policy\nOutputs: RunEvidence and event streams"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: Persistence & Evidence\nRole: SQLite workflow store and projections\nInputs: run, git, delivery, artifact events\nOutputs: materialized workflow truth"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Module: Git Worktree & Delivery\nRole: local git evidence and explicit remote gates\nInputs: branch/worktree/PR actions\nOutputs: commits, checks, merge/sync/cleanup evidence"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Adopt Project Canvas OS\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes\nDepends: live repo inspection\nEvidence: Canvas OS bootstrap validation\nRisk: live checkout vs recalled memory divergence"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Backend-owned planner turns\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: Workflow Kernel, Agent Bridge, Persistence\nEvidence: merged PR #113 / 870b026 and follow-up PR #115 / 26b24ab; both named exact-head CI jobs succeeded\nLevel: Implemented code and CI evidence; real runtime remains Experimental, not Supported\nRisk: local credentials, CLI behavior, and Electron native ABI remain required"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Productize failure repair regression\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: seeded failed-node evidence and checkpoints; same-session mutation lock projection materialization\nEvidence: merged PR #116 / db49a9f with both exact-head CI jobs successful; follow-up fixes 5a7ff29 and 7659475 are on main\nLevel: Implemented foundations; seeded path remains Experimental, not Supported\nRisk: ordinary New Session default loop remains unproductized; local Codex and Electron ABI dependencies; failed evidence must remain visible"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1210,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Task: Harden explicit delivery gates\nState: Proposed\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: git evidence, PR exact-head checks\nEvidence: README delivery surfaces\nRisk: remote side effects need explicit user gates"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Backend-owned planner turns\ncommit: 870b026ab0dc0f949e5e3a932575ca6f5327f301 (PR #113) and 26b24abb77c69d1456330f7a480e5618d96cab35 (PR #115)\nbuild: both PRs have exact-head Build and test SUCCESS and Windows AgentBridge (exact head) SUCCESS\nmain: edd660be7015c972b8b645b6d25e949c1c24210b contains both commits\nBoundary: merged PR/CI evidence only; real-agent acceptance was not rerun here; Experimental, not Supported"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Canvas OS bootstrap validation\ntest: project_canvas_os.py validate --strict -> OK nodes=22 edges=15 warnings=0\naudit: project_canvas_os.py audit --strict -> OK README.md and Project.canvas\nartifact: Project.canvas and .agents/canvas-protocol.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Recalled history differs from live git\nImpact: stale memory can overstate project capability\nMitigation: trust git status, README, tests, and Canvas evidence\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Real agent path is experimental-run\nImpact: local credentials, CLI drift, or native ABI setup can block product acceptance\nMitigation: rebuild Electron native deps, then run acceptance:new-session-ui exactly once\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Decision: Use Project Canvas OS\nRationale: README + Project.canvas are the project state entrypoints\nImpact: no progress-doc sprawl; evidence cards carry truth handles"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Decision: Preserve product boundary\nRationale: SkyTurn is desktop workflow, not IDE or terminal dashboard\nImpact: Canvas stays dominant; details stay in Node Modal tabs"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6c6a9445890c0f7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Failure repair regression\ncommit: db49a9fb43f2a4c2bb3eddf0bd1617afa1e4a430 (PR #116); follow-up fixes 5a7ff29a62cca881b8b1b68d78794750c01e557d and 76594757dfeac57dd1aaa0a54b6bd4c633a9852a\nbuild: PR #116 exact-head Build and test SUCCESS and Windows AgentBridge (exact head) SUCCESS\nmain: edd660be7015c972b8b645b6d25e949c1c24210b contains all three commits\nBoundary: merged PR/CI evidence only; acceptance was not rerun here; seeded path remains Experimental, not Supported"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c3e5f7092b4d6f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Enforce trusted checkpoint ancestry\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: checkpoint-context proof and Electron live Git validation\nEvidence: PR #130 / c587e52 and PR #131 / edd660b merged; both named exact-head CI jobs succeeded for each PR\nLevel: Backend proof gate implemented; Current branch remains Experimental, not Supported\nRisk: legacy no-proof checkpoints stay readable but ancestry-dependent actions fail closed"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3e5a7092b4d6f81",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Trusted checkpoint ancestry\ncommit: c587e522e77a519bab3d6efa851555c5a741cc97 (PR #130) and edd660be7015c972b8b645b6d25e949c1c24210b (PR #131)\nbuild: both PRs have exact-head Build and test SUCCESS and Windows AgentBridge (exact head) SUCCESS\nmain: edd660be7015c972b8b645b6d25e949c1c24210b\nAuthority: Electron/backend validates checkpoint-context proof against live Git; stored claims and renderer state are not proof\nBoundary: legacy checkpoints without proof remain readable, while ancestry-dependent actions fail closed"
    }
  ],
